# Changelog

## [0.2.2] - 2026-07-23

- Pass `:max_body_size` to `Tesla.Middleware.DecompressResponse` (32 MiB cap). The option is mandatory since tesla 1.18.3 / 1.20.0 and every request raised `ArgumentError` without it; older tesla versions ignore it.

## [0.2.1] - 2025-03-03

- fix store_index/2 for handling errors

## [0.2.0] - 2022-11-18

- Added handling of edge cases when using blocking queries
- Added relying on consul's default wait time (which is 5 minutes) when passing `wait: true`
- Extracted index caching from middleware to `Consul.IndexStore` module, which is started on application start instead of `Tesla.Middleware.ConsulWatch`

## [0.1.6] - 2022-05-10

### Added

- Ability to specify the Tesla adapter. Defaults to `nil`
